  "scientific_claim": "The preregistered raw weekly contraction in CFTC TFF Asset Manager option net-percent-of-open-interest did not generalize as a DRA entry-admission factor. Design narrowly missed its one-sided predictive gate. Validation median signed response turned negative and its sign-test p-value was 0.7648. Validation total PnL fell 34.4111 USDT, realized PnL fell 33.9943 USDT, drawdown increased 0.4610 percentage points, P90 holding increased from 1418.3 to 2807 hours, and annual total PnL won only one of five years. The sole positive annual delta was concentrated in 2022. This exact raw-change family is not a candidate and is not a replication of the paper's unavailable non-momentum residual specification.",
